Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery (@resources-materials-map: 0, is #chapter, #resources-and-materials "metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1", #resources-and-materials "../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618", #resources-and-materials "chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/Chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems.lingua#r_05V6FYWMN0VND552CQE94HHA2Q") { r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D
Follow a material from its source and preparation through composition, structure, useful properties, fabrication, inspection, use, and recovery. Connect each transfer with its quantities, evidence, utilities, equipment, maintenance, and human work.

Begin with [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1) for primary and secondary feed, extraction/refining, alloys and transformations, qualified products, service evidence, operation, and recovery. [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../../stem/engineering/mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA) and [Mineralogy and petrology — minerals, crystals, rock processes, and investigation](../../nature/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN) supply connected mineral and preparation knowledge.

Shared methods and scientific models are available through [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), [General chemistry](../../stem/chemistry/general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), and [STEM — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../stem/STEM.lingua#r_4B137J3ZBVM7TD2NA797H2CZ7E). Continue design/construction/operation through [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../stem/engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68) and connected production/upkeep through [Ergon](../Ergon.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001). Questions about purposes, evidence, and assumptions return to [Philosophy](../../philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

Connect industrial substances, reaction/separation systems, useful chemical products and recovery through [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618).

Follow specified chemical feedstocks from origin through suppliers, storage, delivery, acceptance, continuity and recovery in [Chemical feedstocks and supply systems — specified materials from origin to accepted use](chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/Chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems.lingua#r_05V6FYWMN0VND552CQE94HHA2Q).
} r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D

